<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian meat exports fall in January - ABS.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian meat exports fall in January - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for January 1997 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> January  97   2,484	48	     6,714	2,984</p>
<p> December 96   5,943	28	     9,503	3,995</p>
<p> January  96   2,224     195	     6,987	3,063</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> January  97   36,892	169	   3,522	 528</p>
<p> December 96   53,784	171	   4,360	 695</p>
<p> January  96   40,759	 76	   5,398	 424</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
